2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   Dear Sir/Madam,
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   I am reaching out to introduce PlacementHub and explore whether there may be a strategic fit with
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   IDP's Referral Partners in India.
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   PlacementHub is a campus placement and employability platform working with colleges, placement cells,
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   and graduating students across India. We are speaking with overseas education and immigration
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   consultants who may benefit from earlier visibility in the student journey, and who may also see value
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   in participating as strategic partners as the platform grows. PlacementHub is currently in its pre-seed
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   fundraising stage, and I am also soliciting strategic seed investment from aligned partners.
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   For an overseas education or immigration practice, the fit is simple:
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   Access to students while they are still shaping career, higher education, and migration plans.
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   College-led engagement opportunities for seminars, counselling sessions, and structured student outreach.
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   Better context on student goals and readiness, helping your team focus on warmer and more relevant prospects.
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   IDP's Referral Partners in India have consistently demonstrated exceptional expertise in providing comprehensive study abroad guidance, offering reliable visa support, and facilitating seamless overseas education pathways for students, thereby establishing themselves as trusted authorities in the field of international education and immigration services.
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   If this is relevant, I would be happy to share a short investment note and discuss a pilot with
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   selected institutes.
2026-06-19 18:50:47 [INFO   ] PROGRESS |   Please reply to this email or call me if you would like to explore it.
